WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.470 --> 00:00:03.830
We..don't have to imagine any more.

00:00:03.830 --> 00:00:09.390
Oh, Elden Ring..It has an open world, with
roaming encounters that can be engaged in

00:00:09.390 --> 00:00:16.830
different environments..Our character can
use stealth, jump, and fight on horseback.This

00:00:16.830 --> 00:00:25.349
mount can double jump, boost jump..and vanish
into thin air, as we leap off it. and as always..the

00:00:25.349 --> 00:00:29.189
game has this unparalleled art direction and
world building.

00:00:29.189 --> 00:00:33.911
From Software are kings.Elden Ring is coming
to current AND next generation consoles, and

00:00:33.911 --> 00:00:40.830
PC, on January 21st, 2022.. but until then,
let's just gush about this trailer, and talk

00:00:40.830 --> 00:00:46.960
about some of the things you might have missed.

00:00:46.960 --> 00:00:56.440
1The tarnished will soon return.Guided by
grace, once lost.

00:00:56.440 --> 00:01:01.810
This first part reminds me of Sekiro's opening
cinematic, where the maiden approaches us

00:01:01.810 --> 00:01:05.030
after suffering a major setback.

00:01:05.030 --> 00:01:11.850
She affectionately pats the creature that
is, or will be, our mount..takes off her ring,

00:01:11.850 --> 00:01:18.600
for some reason..and instantly fulfils that
ever-present firekeeper role that is so core

00:01:18.600 --> 00:01:22.680
to these games.Oh, and that enormous tree?

00:01:22.680 --> 00:01:24.900
The official site calls it the "Erdtree" (note:
Erde means "earth" in German, but could also

00:01:24.900 --> 00:01:27.080
mean "ancient or ancestral" if it comes from
High Old German), and it quite clearly has

00:01:27.080 --> 00:01:33.510
its roots in Yggdrasil, the World Tree of
Norse mythology..and perhaps the World Spiral

00:01:33.510 --> 00:01:40.020
Tree of Berserk..but we'll talk about that
in the lore video, so subscribe for that.

00:01:40.020 --> 00:01:46.770
At any rate, the website says that at the
source of the Erdtree, "was the Elden Ring,

00:01:46.770 --> 00:01:48.330
which has been shattered".

00:01:48.330 --> 00:01:54.030
And now, the Tarnished will soon return..guided
by grace, once lost.

00:01:54.030 --> 00:02:01.820
We play as these characters..and just as we
were undead, unkindled ash, good hunters in

00:02:01.820 --> 00:02:05.530
games before this, now, we are Tarnished.

00:02:05.530 --> 00:02:08.170
The word "tarnish" has two meanings.

00:02:08.170 --> 00:02:14.410
First, it's when something, usually a metal,
loses its lustre, or becomes corroded.

00:02:14.410 --> 00:02:15.750
Take the Valkyrie, for example.

00:02:15.750 --> 00:02:21.200
Her arm is literally corroding, losing its
lustre.

00:02:21.200 --> 00:02:28.000
Even our hair appears to have lost that red
lustre that she, and the giant in the previous

00:02:28.000 --> 00:02:29.000
trailer, retain.

00:02:29.000 --> 00:02:36.260
Second, when something is tarnished it can
mean it's less valuable, or less respected.

00:02:36.260 --> 00:02:43.099
According to the official site, "the Tarnished
were spurned by the grace of gold and exiled"..thus,

00:02:43.099 --> 00:02:45.569
they have become "less valuable and respected".

00:02:45.569 --> 00:02:51.080
So tarnished is a beautiful word to use here,
because both definitions of the word seem

00:02:51.080 --> 00:02:52.430
to applySecond, it's when something becomes
less valuable, or respected.

00:02:52.430 --> 00:02:53.430
It's a beautiful word to use here, because
both meanings seem to apply.

00:02:53.430 --> 00:02:54.430
Secondly, according to the official site,
"the Tarnished were spurned by the grace of

00:02:54.430 --> 00:02:55.430
gold and exiled"..thus, they have also become
"less valuable and respected".

00:02:55.430 --> 00:02:57.090
This brings us to the "Golden Order".

00:02:57.090 --> 00:03:03.430
It seems we, as Tarnished..were once a part
of it, and exiled long ago.

00:03:03.430 --> 00:03:34.170
For the Elden Ring has been shattered, and..2The
Golden Order is broken to its core.Let's talk

00:03:34.170 --> 00:03:40.739
about our mount, who a lot of people have
started calling Yakul, on account of its similarities

00:03:40.739 --> 00:03:44.959
to the Red Elk in Princess Mononoke.

00:03:44.959 --> 00:03:50.580
This wouldn't be the first time Miyazaki or
his designers were inspired by that movie..and

00:03:50.580 --> 00:03:57.130
Yakul here is certainly capable of some seriously
gravity-defying jumps, just like his movie

00:03:57.130 --> 00:03:58.420
counterpart.These scenes are so beautiful..it's
going to be so fun riding through open plains..over

00:03:58.420 --> 00:03:59.900
rocky terrain..past giant walking castle islands
with giant dongs..On the Japanese Elden Ring

00:03:59.900 --> 00:04:06.659
site, it's called a "spirit horse"..which
explains its ability to suddenly appear and

00:04:06.659 --> 00:04:09.300
vanish beneath us.

00:04:09.300 --> 00:04:15.300
This has interesting implications for the
gameplay - Imagine summoning Yakul in combat

00:04:15.300 --> 00:04:20.680
for a quick burst of speed, or in order to
make a getaway.It also makes me wonder when

00:04:20.680 --> 00:04:26.160
it is beneficial to engage in mounted combat,
vs traditional combat.

00:04:26.160 --> 00:04:30.660
Perhaps mounted combat is really good against
other mounted enemies, for example?

00:04:30.660 --> 00:04:36.020
- that's what happens in this scene after
all - the player character engages in a sort

00:04:36.020 --> 00:04:43.870
of joust with a mounted enemy..charging their
sword attack, and releasing at just the right

00:04:43.870 --> 00:04:44.870
moment.

00:04:44.870 --> 00:04:50.430
Of course, it doesn't look like mounted combat
is always going to be this chivalrous.

00:04:50.430 --> 00:04:56.120
The character in this screenshot, for example..looks
just about ready to leap off his horse, onto

00:04:56.120 --> 00:05:01.250
us..and later on in the trailer, we do exactly
that..with Yakul vanishing beneath us.

00:05:01.250 --> 00:05:10.360
This mob of hollows and the mounted enemy
are escorts, walking with the two giants and

00:05:10.360 --> 00:05:18.250
the carriage they pull via a spike and chain
plunged through their chests.

00:05:18.250 --> 00:05:22.740
What's cool about this encounter.. is that
because this is an open world, wandering mobs

00:05:22.740 --> 00:05:28.740
like this will absolutely venture through
different territories and terrains..meaning

00:05:28.740 --> 00:05:34.990
every player might encounter them in different
places..with different advantages and disadvantages.In

00:05:34.990 --> 00:05:42.460
fact, that's exactly what's happening in this
screenshot.

00:05:42.460 --> 00:05:51.509
According to a press release, Elden Ring will
have a "natural weather and time-or-day progression",

00:05:51.509 --> 00:05:57.580
and here, we see the player sneaking in some
tall grass, their stealth enhanced by the

00:05:57.580 --> 00:06:00.539
cover of rainfall, and night.

00:06:00.539 --> 00:06:05.580
If the stealth system from Sekiro is truly
in place, then I bet you can take out the

00:06:05.580 --> 00:06:12.330
caravan one by one, rather than head-on in
the daytime, as we saw in the video.

00:06:12.330 --> 00:06:22.600
I bet the loot is pretty good - these hollows
are literally carrying chests, after all..Thinking

00:06:22.600 --> 00:06:29.010
critically about how to use the open world
to your advantage sounds like so much fun.

00:06:29.010 --> 00:06:32.790
I bet you can do the same thing here with
the walking island.

00:06:32.790 --> 00:06:39.949
We all noticed the giant dong beneath..but
did you see that there's also a building above?

00:06:39.949 --> 00:06:48.080
I bet you can wait for this island to wander
into different territory, and jump off a nearby

00:06:48.080 --> 00:06:50.389
cliff ON to the island.

00:06:50.389 --> 00:06:58.060
Open world games are at their best with dynamic
events and puzzles like this..and it looks

00:06:58.060 --> 00:07:04.270
like FROM are thinking really creatively.

00:07:04.270 --> 00:07:05.270
I'm here for it.

00:07:05.270 --> 00:07:11.750
3.Foul Tarnished,In search of the Elden RingEmboldened
by the flame of ambition.Someone must extinguish

00:07:11.750 --> 00:07:12.750
thy flame.

00:07:12.750 --> 00:07:30.580
The 

00:07:30.580 --> 00:07:37.190
voice acting here is incredible, timed perfectly
with the swell of the music and the scenery

00:07:37.190 --> 00:07:44.300
in the trailer..but it's that "flame of ambition"
line I love the most - because it speaks to

00:07:44.300 --> 00:07:48.740
the slight tonal shift this game has from
Dark Souls.

00:07:48.740 --> 00:07:58.030
Dark Souls is the story of downtrodden undead
trying to hold onto their vestiges of life..but

00:07:58.030 --> 00:08:06.199
the Tarnished feel like they're fighting for
their right to the glory, lordship, and status

00:08:06.199 --> 00:08:08.720
that they've been denied.

00:08:08.720 --> 00:08:16.050
That's a significant difference, in my opinion.This
increased sense of character agency translates

00:08:16.050 --> 00:08:18.110
well to the open world.

00:08:18.110 --> 00:08:23.850
Here, you have more control over you path
- choosing which castles to conquer, or which

00:08:23.850 --> 00:08:25.520
caves to explore.

00:08:25.520 --> 00:08:32.000
I'm also really excited for the gameplay variety
this should introduce..because you'll be going

00:08:32.000 --> 00:08:41.389
between an open world with dynamic encounters,
to more tightly designed dungeons with the

00:08:41.389 --> 00:08:48.790
level design that we know and love.

00:08:48.790 --> 00:08:55.420
In many of these spaces, the character wields
a torch - giving you light in exchange for

00:08:55.420 --> 00:08:58.850
a shield, or two-handing your weapon.

00:08:58.850 --> 00:09:03.420
Speaking of weapons, many seem to come with
animations pulled straight from Dark Souls

00:09:03.420 --> 00:09:10.239
3 - for example, this is the weapon art of
the Old Wolf Curved Sword..this is literally

00:09:10.239 --> 00:09:15.319
the quickstep animation you get from holding
a dagger or short axe..this is the rolling

00:09:15.319 --> 00:09:22.319
attack of the short bow, and there are many
similar magic weaopn arts, as well.4They will

00:09:22.319 --> 00:09:33.420
fight, and they will die.In an undending curse.That..sounds
familiar.

00:09:33.420 --> 00:09:42.129
Honestly, there's a lot familiar in this trailer
- but there's so much that's new, as well.

00:09:42.129 --> 00:09:43.241
The terrain is so traversable..and you can
even leap off of Yakul to get the jump on

00:09:43.241 --> 00:09:44.241
enemies, as his spirit dissipates beneath
you.So, mentioned right after your "spirit

00:09:44.241 --> 00:09:48.800
horse", the website also mentions "spirit
bodies", summonable help that seem a little

00:09:48.800 --> 00:09:53.230
bit more unique than the usual phantoms we
summon in Souls games.

00:09:53.230 --> 00:09:57.200
There's even a spirit bird in one of these
screenshots that reminds me of Father Owl's

00:09:57.200 --> 00:09:58.689
summon..but I can't be sure this is the same
thing.

00:09:58.689 --> 00:10:03.449
It's probably a good time to mention again
that the game has multiplayer, probably very

00:10:03.449 --> 00:10:07.230
similar to what we had in Dark Souls, so don't
worry about that.

00:10:07.230 --> 00:10:10.739
But here is the last scene I want to talk
about in this segment.

00:10:10.739 --> 00:10:17.290
It's night here, more evidence of a rolling
day and night system in the game..but most

00:10:17.290 --> 00:10:22.879
interestingly, the character is sitting at
a small camp.

00:10:22.879 --> 00:10:32.679
Cut content in Dark Souls 3 showed them experimenting
with the idea of moveable bonfires and checkpoints..so

00:10:32.679 --> 00:10:37.679
what if they finally implemented this idea
in Elden Ring?

00:10:37.679 --> 00:10:43.160
What if you can move your camp around, starting
back here if you die?

00:10:43.160 --> 00:10:51.149
It would make a lot of sense for an open world
game like this..and I'm willing to bet that's

00:10:51.149 --> 00:10:54.670
exactly what's going on here.

00:10:54.670 --> 00:10:55.800
5

00:10:55.800 --> 00:11:07.511
For how else is a ch ampion, or a Lord, to
be born?

00:11:07.511 --> 00:11:13.740
According to Namco's official site, it's our
goal to "become the Elden Lord"..and it's

00:11:13.740 --> 00:11:19.161
probably no coincidence that this line about
lords aligns with our fight against the Valkyrie

00:11:19.161 --> 00:11:22.620
character, who is clearly more lordly than
we are.

00:11:22.620 --> 00:11:23.930
Unlike us, her long hair is bright red..so
I wonder if ours is simply faded, and what

00:11:23.930 --> 00:11:24.930
our relation to her might be.

00:11:24.930 --> 00:11:30.569
Later, when I feel more confident, I'll talk
more deeply about the lore we know so far..so

00:11:30.569 --> 00:11:34.089
please, subscribe for that.

00:11:34.089 --> 00:11:38.739
Now, you might have been too distracted by
the archdragon plucking lightning bolts from

00:11:38.739 --> 00:11:47.860
the sky to notice, but Yakul actually performs
a double jump here.

00:11:47.860 --> 00:11:54.290
The player also gets a jump of their own,
just like in Sekiro..so expect a LOT of verticality

00:11:54.290 --> 00:11:59.359
to be present in these levels..and expect
lots of hidden paths to explore.

00:11:59.359 --> 00:12:04.230
Take these graves on this cliff face, for
instance...

00:12:04.230 --> 00:12:08.760
6
Well..a lowly Tarnished, playing as a Lord.

00:12:08.760 --> 00:12:13.899
I command thee KNEEL!

00:12:13.899 --> 00:12:20.509
This..appears to be the same character from
the original trailer, who was stitching arms

00:12:20.509 --> 00:12:21.509
together.

00:12:21.509 --> 00:12:27.649
He's been busy these past two years, apparently..and
now has a cascade of limbs, some clutching

00:12:27.649 --> 00:12:30.689
additional weapons, to barrage you with.

00:12:30.689 --> 00:12:36.800
He even stitches a dragon head onto one arm
at some point..holy shit.

00:12:36.800 --> 00:12:44.749
He seems to be important..and his main weapon
has a lion crest on it..the same crest you

00:12:44.749 --> 00:12:48.709
see on many enemies and banners throughout
this trailer.

00:12:48.709 --> 00:12:52.259
Perhaps he's the main boss of this area?

00:12:52.259 --> 00:12:57.170
Speaking of which..I assume this area..with
the tree, and the plains, and the castle..I

00:12:57.170 --> 00:13:04.119
assume it's all a part of one kingdom, and
that there are many other open worlds to explore

00:13:04.119 --> 00:13:05.930
that we haven't seen yet.

00:13:05.930 --> 00:13:06.930
7

00:13:08.832 --> 00:13:13.371
But thank you for watching and supporting,
and enjoy watching the channel for the next

00:13:13.371 --> 00:13:16.382
few weeks, as we discuss this game to death.

00:13:16.382 --> 00:13:17.382
I'll see you soon.

00:13:17.382 --> 00:13:18.382
So two years ago, when the Elden Ring trailer
first aired..I had a brilliant idea.

00:13:18.382 --> 00:13:19.382
I know!

00:13:19.382 --> 00:13:20.382
I'll commission a merch design inspired by
Elden Ring, and I'll release it the next time

00:13:20.382 --> 00:13:21.382
they release elden ring news.

00:13:21.382 --> 00:13:22.382
Well..now, 700 days later..it's finally here.

00:13:22.382 --> 00:13:22.396
The elden valkyrie..a helmet design inspired
by the valkyrie character in the e3 trialer.

